==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*werǵ-}}
The past participle of {{der|en|enm|werken||to work}}, from {{inh|en|ang|wyrċan}} (past tense {{m|ang|worhte}}, past participle {{m|ang|ġeworht}}), from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*wurkijan|}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*wurkijaną||to work}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*werǵ-||to work}}. Doublet of [[worked]].

Cognate with {{m|en|wright}} (as in {{m|en|wheelwright}} etc.), {{cog|nl|gewrocht}}, archaic past participle of {{m|nl|werken}} (archaic past tense {{m|nl|wrocht}}), {{cog|nds|wracht}}, archaic past participle of {{m|nds|warken}} (archaic past tense {{m|nds|wrach}}, archaic past participle {{m|nds|wracht}}).

